1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,016
Every turn, one of your cards goes face-down.

2
00:00:03,335 --> 00:00:05,128
So what happens when you run out?

3
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:07,562
Look at Ana's cards.

4
00:00:07,882 --> 00:00:09,589
Three of them are face-down.

5
00:00:10,699 --> 00:00:12,854
Her last card is called Spirit Power.

6
00:00:13,174 --> 00:00:16,972
She may use it only when at least three other cards are face-down.

7
00:00:18,099 --> 00:00:19,166
Now she can.

8
00:00:19,486 --> 00:00:21,001
She picks Spirit Power.

9
00:00:22,133 --> 00:00:24,287
Look at the two Spirit cards in the middle.

10
00:00:24,607 --> 00:00:26,933
She chooses one of the two top cards.

11
00:00:28,033 --> 00:00:29,270
She picks the Wolf.

12
00:00:29,590 --> 00:00:33,067
The Wolf says: add four stones to the bowl, then take one.

13
00:00:35,549 --> 00:00:37,555
Four new stones go into the bowl.

14
00:00:39,016 --> 00:00:40,211
And she takes one.

15
00:00:40,531 --> 00:00:42,195
Another white for her Turtle.

16
00:00:43,299 --> 00:00:45,561
The Wolf goes to the bottom of its pile.

17
00:00:45,881 --> 00:00:47,993
A new Spirit card is now on top.

18
00:00:49,649 --> 00:00:51,079
And now the best part.

19
00:00:51,399 --> 00:00:53,724
All of Ana's cards turn face-up again!

20
00:00:54,044 --> 00:00:55,665
She can use them all again.

21
00:00:56,766 --> 00:00:58,281
So the game has a rhythm.

22
00:00:58,601 --> 00:01:00,563
Use your cards, one each turn.

23
00:01:00,883 --> 00:01:03,273
Then use Spirit Power to get them all back.

24
00:01:04,399 --> 00:01:06,405
There are six different Spirit cards.

25
00:01:06,725 --> 00:01:08,602
Episode ten shows each one.

26
00:01:09,733 --> 00:01:10,629
Remember.

27
00:01:10,949 --> 00:01:13,573
Spirit Power needs three face-down cards.

28
00:01:13,893 --> 00:01:17,349
Choose one of the two top Spirit cards, and do what it says.

29
00:01:17,669 --> 00:01:19,589
Then all your cards turn face-up.

30
00:01:19,909 --> 00:01:21,253
Next: the Coyote.
